<% title "Set-password link for #{@user.login}" %>

<h1>Set-password link for <%= link_to @user.login, user_path(@user) %></h1>

<% if @user.fbid? %>
  <p>This account was created with Facebook login.</p>
<% end %>
<% if @user.email? %>
  <p>It has an email address on file, so they can also use "Forgot your password?" on the login page.</p>
<% end %>

<p>Send this link to the person. It lets them choose a new password and log in, works once, and expires in 7 days. Only send it once you're sure they own the account.</p>

<p><%= text_field_tag :link, @link, readonly: true, onclick: 'this.select()', style: 'width: 100%' %></p>
